@startuml
[*] --> Visitor

Visitor --> RegisteredUnverified : Sign up
RegisteredUnverified --> Verified : Verify email token
RegisteredUnverified --> RegisteredUnverified : Resend verification
RegisteredUnverified --> Visitor : Signup abandoned

Verified --> LoggedIn : Login success
Verified --> PasswordResetPending : Forgot password

PasswordResetPending --> Verified : Reset password success
PasswordResetPending --> Verified : Token expires / cancelled

LoggedIn --> ProfileManaged : Update profile
ProfileManaged --> LoggedIn : Save complete

LoggedIn --> CropSaved : Save selected crop
CropSaved --> LoggedIn : Persisted

LoggedIn --> CropRemoved : Remove selected crop
CropRemoved --> LoggedIn : Persisted

LoggedIn --> LoggedOut : Logout
LoggedOut --> LoggedIn : Login again
LoggedOut --> [*]
@enduml
